      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "ベヘルダ暴斧団をご存知ですか？\n奴らには商会の荷馬車を何台もやられています。\nお願いしてもいいですか？　依頼は奴らの殲滅です。\n一人残らず倒してください！",
        "official_en": "You've heard of the Behelda Axes, haven't you? Well,\nthey've been attacking Vandahl Trading wagons. But\nit has to stop! You seem strong, so please, put an end\nto every last one of them!",
        "real_en": "You've heard of the Beherda Savage-Axe Gang, haven't you? Well,\nthey've been attacking Vandahl Trading wagons. But\nit has to stop! You seem strong, so please, put an end\nto every last one of them!"
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
    },
