      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "殲滅、と言いましたが、凶暴な奴らのこと\nせいぜい怪我を負わせるくらいでいいと\n考えていましたが……お見事です！\nあなたたちを敵にまわしたくないですね……",
        "official_en": "I know I said \"end them\" but I just thought you'd\nrough them up a bit and make them stop... Well, I\nguess they had it coming. Well done! Remind me not\nto get on your bad side...",
